                "text": "Medicaid supports 1.8M people in the Valley\u2014but cutting it hurts everyone. It keeps rural hospitals open, funds local clinics, and helps pay doctors and nurses. \n\nWithout it, even folks with private insurance will face longer wait times, fewer providers, and ERs stretched past the breaking point. Learn more\u2b07\ufe0f\nhttps://t.co/WqIHRGBQVT",
