                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "Republicans are pushing Medicaid cuts in their \u201cOne Big, Ugly Bill\u201d - and the consequences go far beyond just those enrolled.  \n \nHospitals rely on Medicaid funding, and cuts could mean longer ER wait times, delays, and reduced services \u2013 even here in the Valley.  \n \nThis reckless GOP bill threatens health care access for families across the country.",
