                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "Medicaid cuts don\u2019t just hurt patients \u2014 they strain hospitals.\n\nHospitals like Valley Children\u2019s and Community Regional Medical Center will be stretched thin with fewer staff, longer waits, and higher costs. When hospitals suffer, so do we.",
