                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 2,
                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "What do Medicaid (Medi-Cal) cuts mean for the Valley?\n\nThis means fewer services and funding for our hospitals:  \n\ud83d\udd39 75% of patients at Valley Children\u2019s rely on Medi-Cal  \n\ud83d\udd39 Over 50% at Community Regional Medical Centers \n\ud83d\udd39 Nearly 40% at Kaweah Health Medical Center \n\nThese cuts threaten the care our communities depend on. We can\u2019t afford them. Not now. Not ever.",
