                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Dialysis is life-saving care. I met with Valley patients who rely on dialysis to discuss legislation that would be critical to them and their families. \n\nI\u2019m working to protect life-saving care for Valley families because no one should be left behind. https://t.co/KOxEtQKlmT",
