                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "For 60 years, Medicaid has helped power Valley clinics and hospitals.\n\nOn this #MedicaidDayofAction, we say no to cuts that would gut funding, close rural clinics, and take care away from nearly 250,000+ people in the Valley. Health care is a right, not a budget line. https://t.co/fRekaYLmXn",
