                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "Every day, 13 Americans die while waiting for a lifesaving organ. It is critical for families, patients, and our community that we have a fair, transparent, and accountable system for organ donation.\n\nAlong with @RepBethVanDuyne and @RonWyden, I introduced the Permanent OPTN Fee Authority Act in hopes of modernizing our organ transplant system by placing it under direct and fully transparent federal oversight.",
