                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "As open enrollment continues, I want to remind Valley families that you still have time to secure quality, affordable health insurance.\n\nTo begin coverage on January 1, 2026, be sure to enroll by Monday, December 15 at https://t.co/GgiFAmvnIx.",
