                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "Affordable Care Act tax credits must be extended, or premiums will skyrocket on January 1 \u2013 hitting hardworking Valley families. \n\nWe need a real bipartisan solution that lowers costs and protects care, not bills that do the exact opposite.  \n\nMy colleagues and I are continuing to fight for lower healthcare costs and pto rotect access to care.",
